  "body": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6MclX9ZhyUw?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>天色<rt>틸ˉ셱</rt></ruby> <ruby>烏陰<rt>어ˉ임ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thḭ̄-siek ōr-îm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>強<rt>경-</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>喘<rt>촨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>氣<rt>키</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiong-bêh-choân-boe-kuè-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>驚惶<rt>걀ˉ햘ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>孤單<rt>거ˉ돨ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiā̰-hiá̰ kōr-toâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>奮鬥<rt>훈ˋᄃᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>款<rt>콴ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>生活<rt>솅ˉ왛ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hùn-tàu-ti-jît-khoàn siēng-oâh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>身軀<rt>신ˉ쿠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>拍拚<rt>팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>傷痕<rt>셩ˉ훈ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sīn-khû phâh-pia̰’e siōng-hún\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby>헤<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>青春<rt>촁ˉ춘ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hè tio-si-goà’e chiēng-chûn\n  </span>\n</span></p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>煩惱<rt>환로ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>憂傷<rt>유ˉ셩ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-lò yū-siông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>凡事<rt>환수ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀</rt></ruby><ruby>定著<rt>댤둏ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-sū lông-bo-tia̰-tiôh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>彷徨<rt>벙헝ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>艱苦<rt>간ˉ커ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pong-hóng kān-khòr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    가<ruby>當做<rt>덩ˉ죄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>普通<rt>퍼ˆ텅ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>平常<rt>볭셩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ka-tōng-joè-phôr-thōng-pieng-sióng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>跤踏實地<rt>카ˉ닿싣데ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khā-tah-sit-tē’e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏</rt></ruby><ruby>未來<rt>삐래ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>做夢<rt>죄ˋ빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    làn wi-tioh-bi-lái joè-bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        你有我 我有你\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        nǐ yǒu wǒ wǒ yǒu nǐ\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        我們一起\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        wǒ men yī qǐ\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        勇敢地 相信著\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        yǒng gǎn de xiāng xìn zhe\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        不畏挫折\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        bù wèi cuò zhé\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        我們把自己拯救\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        wǒ men bǎ zì jǐ zhěng jiù\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        彼此扶持邁進不曾停留\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        bǐ cǐ fú chí mài jìn bù céng tíng liú\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        傻了嗎 衝了嗎\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        shǎ le ma chōng le ma\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        準備出發\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        zhǔn bèi chū fā\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        不害怕 更揮灑\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        bù hài pà gèng huī sǎ\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        在眼淚中遠望\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        zài yǎn lèi zhōng yuǎn wàng\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        我們曾走過的地方\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        wǒ men céng zǒu guò de dì fāng\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>相信<rt>셩ˉ신</rt></ruby>’됴\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    làn siōng-sin’tio\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一枝<rt>짇기ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>草<rt>ᄎᅷˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우</rt></ruby><ruby>一點<rt>짇댬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>露<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-kī-chàu u-jit-tiâm-lōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>行<rt>걀-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人生<rt>띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>陣陣<rt>준준ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>風雨<rt>헝ˉ허ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    làn kia̰-kuè-rin-siêng jun-jūn’e hōng-hōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>憑<rt>빈-</rt></ruby><ruby>一寡<rt>짇과ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>勇氣<rt>영ˆ키</rt></ruby> <ruby>使然<rt>수ˆ뗸ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>粗魯<rt>처ˉ러ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pin-jit-koâ-yông-khi sû-rién’e chōr-lòr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우</rt></ruby><ruby>失志<rt>싣ˆ지</rt></ruby> <ruby>喪膽<rt>성ˋ달ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kôh-u-sît-ji sòng-tà̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siâ̰-mîh lông-m-kiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    ’에 <ruby>當初<rt>덩ˉ처ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ’e tōng-chôr\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        敢傻敢衝\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        gǎn shǎ gǎn chōng\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        拯救世界越用力就越感動\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        zhěng jiù shì jiè yuè yòng lì jiù yuè gǎn dòng\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        請抓住我的手\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        qǐng zhuā zhù wǒ de shǒu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        讓我們繼續走\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        ràng wǒ men jì xù zǒu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        我相信敢傻是 我的本事\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        wǒ xiāng xìn gǎn shǎ shì wǒ de běn shì\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        傻了嗎 衝了嗎\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        shǎ le ma chōng le ma\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        準備出發\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        zhǔn bèi chū fā\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        不害怕 更揮灑\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        bù hài pà gèng huī sǎ\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        在眼淚中遠望\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        zài yǎn lèi zhōng yuǎn wàng\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        我們曾走過的地方\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        wǒ men céng zǒu guò de dì fāng\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>相信<rt>셩ˉ신</rt></ruby>’됴\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    làn siōng-sin’tio\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一枝<rt>짇기ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>草<rt>ᄎᅷˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우</rt></ruby><ruby>一點<rt>짇댬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>露<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-kī-chàu u-jit-tiâm-lōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>行<rt>걀-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人生<rt>띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>陣陣<rt>준준ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>風雨<rt>헝ˉ허ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    làn kia̰-kuè-rin-siêng jun-jūn’e hōng-hōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>憑<rt>빈-</rt></ruby><ruby>一寡<rt>짇과ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>勇氣<rt>영ˆ키</rt></ruby> <ruby>使然<rt>수ˆ뗸ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>粗魯<rt>처ˉ러ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pin-jit-koâ-yông-khi sû-rién’e chōr-lòr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우</rt></ruby><ruby>失志<rt>싣ˆ지</rt></ruby> <ruby>喪膽<rt>성ˋ달ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kôh-u-sît-ji sòng-tà̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siâ̰-mîh lông-m-kiâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    ’에 <ruby>當初<rt>덩ˉ처ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ’e tōng-chôr\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        敢傻敢衝\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        gǎn shǎ gǎn chōng\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        拯救世界越用力就越感動\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        zhěng jiù shì jiè yuè yòng lì jiù yuè gǎn dòng\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        請抓住我的手\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        qǐng zhuā zhù wǒ de shǒu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        讓我們繼續走\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        ràng wǒ men jì xù zǒu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif\">\n    <